        </div>

        <div class="cards-grid">
            <div class="card-custom">
                <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-laptop-code"></i></div>
                <h3 class="card-title">AI Web App Development</h3>
                <p class="card-text">Intelligent web applications that automate business processes, improve user experience, and provide real-time insights.</p>
                <ul class="card-list">
                    <li>AI-powered dashboards &amp; analytics</li>
                    <li>Business management systems</li>
                    <li>Customer portals &amp; SaaS apps</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card-custom">
                <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i></div>
                <h3 class="card-title">AI Mobile App Development</h3>
                <p class="card-text">Modern mobile applications built natively for iOS and Android platforms with seamless cloud sync and AI capabilities.</p>
                <ul class="card-list">
                    <li>Customer &amp; Employee apps</li>
                    <li>Field service &amp; Booking apps</li>
                    <li>AI assistants &amp; productivity tools</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card-custom">
                <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-cloud"></i></div>
                <h3 class="card-title">SaaS Product Development</h3>
