                <ul class="card-list">
                    <li>Product strategy &amp; UI/UX design</li>
                    <li>Cloud &amp; Database architecture</li>
                    <li>Subscription management &amp; AI integration</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card-custom">
                <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-network-wired"></i></div>
                <h3 class="card-title">Software Integrations</h3>
                <p class="card-text">Connect disparate software systems into one unified intelligent ecosystem with robust API integrations.</p>
                <ul class="card-list">
                    <li>Xero, QuickBooks &amp; MYOB</li>
